# Never cache PWA bootstrap files at the CDN or browser.
# Cloudflare was serving stale sw.js for hours (max-age=14400), blocking SW updates.
# After first deploy with these headers, purge Cloudflare cache once for /sw.js if needed.
@pwa_critical path /sw.js /offline.html /manifest.webmanifest
header @pwa_critical {
	Cache-Control "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate"
	Pragma "no-cache"
	Expires "0"
	CDN-Cache-Control "no-store"
}
